            "review_text": "Oscardog16\nAdelaide, Australia3345 contributions\n0\nConvenient in-house dining\nFeb 2023\nWe are Accor members and staying at the Novotel, so somewhat of a captive audience with the dining privileges. I enjoyed the whole red snapper, and my partner ordered the pork ribs. The ribs were a bit dry but acceptable. The service provided by Tuyen was exceptional. We would not have gone out of our way to eat at this restaurant, except there was a very limited choice around the resort.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 20, 2023",
