            "review_text": "Tyson P\nMaidstone, Australia3 contributions\n0\nWorst restaurant in Phu Quoc\nFeb 2020 • Family\nWent there for lunch, family of 4.\nConsidering the restaurant is part of Novotel and call Phu Quoc seafood restaurant you would think the seafood is fresh. We ordered a seafood plater with swimmer crabs. We got tiny rotten crabs and frozen seafood, told the waiter the crabs were off, she just ignore us and left. \n\nBut most importantly what is Novotel doing serving unsustainable undersized seafood? the crabs were the size of an oyster!\nRead more\nWritten February 1, 2020",
