            "review_text": "Vien Nguyen\nHelsinki, Finland60 contributions\n0\nGood food but so much overpriced\nMay 2018 • Friends\nOK. We were here since we stayed at Novotel resort which is far from city centre and it's good to give a try. It looks very nice restaurant indeed. Food is quite good and tasty but doesn't deserve such price. The live music makes so much noise for us since the restaurant is very small. We also ordered two cocktails, which we expected to have them delivered to our room. However, finally they gave two plastic glasses for us to take away, which look very ugly, especially for drinking cocktail. Soft plastic also makes it difficult to drink.\nRead more\nWritten May 12, 2018",
